Package: rode-codex
Version: {version}
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: {architecture}
Maintainer: {maintainer}
Installed-Size: {installed_size}
Enhances: rode
Homepage: https://github.com/openai/codex
Description: optional native Codex runtime for RODE
 A pinned upstream Codex executable with checksum metadata and license notices.
 RODE discovers this runtime for local and SSH project agent chat.
 Authentication and model services are configured separately.
 No Node.js, npm, editor daemon or model is installed.
